{"id":4521,"date":"2025-02-14T13:29:04","date_gmt":"2025-02-14T03:59:04","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?post_type=demo&#038;p=4521"},"modified":"2025-02-14T14:56:50","modified_gmt":"2025-02-14T05:26:50","slug":"use-the-feed-editor-to-update-product-attributes","status":"publish","type":"demo","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/use-the-feed-editor-to-update-product-attributes\/","title":{"rendered":"Use the Feed Editor to Update Product Attributes"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"4521\" class=\"elementor elementor-4521\" data-elementor-post-type=\"demo\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fcc34cd e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"fcc34cd\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cbe1ba7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cbe1ba7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"81\" data-end=\"190\">Learn how to efficiently update product attributes using the <strong data-start=\"161\" data-end=\"176\">Feed Editor<\/strong> in FeedOps.<\/p><ul data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"581\"><li data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"289\"><strong data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"217\">Customize Your View<\/strong>: Select only the columns you need, such as Material, Brand, or Color.<\/li><li data-start=\"290\" data-end=\"397\"><strong data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"311\">Filter Products<\/strong>: Apply filters to update specific items, like products with &#8220;Leather&#8221; in the title.<\/li><li data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"482\"><strong data-start=\"400\" data-end=\"416\">Edit in Bulk<\/strong>: Make changes across multiple products at once for consistency.<\/li><li data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"581\"><strong data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"505\">Automate Updates<\/strong>: Use Feed Rules to dynamically adjust attributes based on set conditions.<\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"649\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Keep your product feed accurate and optimized with minimal effort.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"featured_media":4524,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","class_list":["post-4521","demo","type-demo","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Use the Feed Editor to Update Product Attributes - FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn how to update product attributes efficiently using the Feed Editor in FeedOps. , Filter products, and Apply bulk updates with ease.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/use-the-feed-editor-to-update-product-attributes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Use the Feed Editor to Update Product Attributes\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Learn how to update product attributes efficiently using the Feed Editor in FeedOps. , Filter products, and Apply bulk updates with ease.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/demo\/use-the-feed-editor-to-update-product-attributes\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-02-14T05:26:50+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/How-to-use-Bulk-Editor-youtube-t